    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1520-a3">

                <pb facs="1227" n="1111" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg1111"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3.—Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The President of Nicaragua to
                        the American Minister</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <placeName type="venue"><hi rendition="#small-caps">National
                                Palace</hi></placeName>, <lb/>
                            <placeName type="city"><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Managua</hi></placeName></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1912-02-18">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 18, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Minister</hi>: I am performing a most pleasant
                    duty in offering to the Secretary of State, Mr. Philander G. Knox, and to his
                    distinguished family through the worthy medium of your excellency the
                    presidential house for the residence of the illustrious guests during their
                    approaching visit to Nicaragua.</p>
                <p>Believe, Mr. Minister, in the sincerity of this offer, which I make for the
                    better comfort of the notable travelers, and which, saving your better judgment,
                    resolves satisfactorily a detail quite important for the welfare of these
                    honorable guests of the Nation.</p>
                <p>I beg you, Mr. Minister, when honoring me with your reply, not to entertain any
                    unjustifiable fear of occasioning inconvenience, since even now the necessary
                    dispositions have been made in the hope that your valued reply will be
                    favorable.</p>
                <p>I take [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Adolfo Díaz.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
